## stb_truetype — Sean Barrett (`nothings`)

- **Upstream:** https://github.com/nothings/stb
- **License:** MIT / public domain (dual; pick either)
- **Author:** Sean Barrett

`andrewrk/TrueType` (and so transitively `src/truetype.zig`) is a
port of Sean Barrett's single-header `stb_truetype.h`.  Almost all
the algorithm-level work for parsing TTF tables and rasterizing
glyphs traces back to Sean.  Acknowledged by transitive lineage.

