## zg — Sam Atman and contributors

- **Upstream:** https://codeberg.org/atman/zg
- **License:** MIT (per upstream README and predecessor lineage)
- **Author:** Sam Atman (and zg / ziglyph contributors)

zimr vendors `code_point.zig` from zg at
`src/_vendor/zg/code_point.zig` for UTF-8 decoding with
Maximal-Subparts error recovery.  zg descends from `ziglyph` by
José Colón (`jecolon`), which is MIT-licensed.

The DFA tables and decode loop in `code_point.zig` themselves are
adapted from Björn Höhrmann's UTF-8 decoder — see next entry.

---

## UTF-8 DFA decoder — Björn Höhrmann

- **Upstream:** https://bjoern.hoehrmann.de/utf-8/decoder/dfa/
- **License:** MIT
- **Author:** Björn Höhrmann

The decision-graph tables inside `src/_vendor/zg/code_point.zig`
implement Björn Höhrmann's UTF-8 DFA, a beautifully compact and
fast UTF-8 validator/decoder.  Acknowledged by zg's source as
"Credit for the algorithm goes to Björn Höhrmann".

