## Roboto Mono — Christian Robertson (Google)

- **Upstream:** https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Roboto+Mono
- **License:** Apache 2.0
- **Author:** Christian Robertson and the Google Fonts team

`assets/RobotoMono-Regular.ttf` is shipped in the repository and
embedded at compile time into the `text_layout` example via
`@embedFile`.  Used to demonstrate the TTF loading path
(`text.loadFontFromTtfData`) end-to-end.  Apache 2.0 is
permissive and compatible with zlib for redistribution; the
Apache notice does not need to be reproduced in source-form
distributions of the font itself, but we acknowledge the
authorship here for completeness.

