## mr_ecs — Mason Remaley and contributors (Games-by-Mason)

- **Upstream:** https://codeberg.org/Games-by-Mason/mr_ecs
- **License:** MIT
- **Author:** Mason Remaley and mr_ecs contributors

zimr's `src/entities.zig` is adapted from `mr_ecs`, an
archetype-based ECS for Zig.  zimr's port strips the upstream
features that don't make sense for a single-threaded WASM target:
no Tracy profiling hooks, no `mr_geom` math (zimr uses `math.zig`
instead), no threading primitives (`CmdPool`, `forEachAsync`,
`forEachChunkAsync`), no `Transform` integration.  The single-file
result is hosted at `src/entities.zig`.

The MIT license text is reproduced inline at the top of
`src/entities.zig` per the upstream license's notice-preservation
clause.  For convenience (and so this file is a complete
attribution record), it's also reproduced here:

