## Box2D — Erin Catto (`@erincatto`)

- **Upstream:** https://github.com/erincatto/box2d
- **License:** MIT
- **Author:** Erin Catto and Box2D contributors

zimr's `src/zimrphysics2d.zig` is a faithful Zig port of Box2D
v3.1 — Erin Catto's data-oriented C rewrite with the "TGS Soft"
solver — reproducing the algorithm term-for-term: the soft-step
solver, contact-manifold generation, the median-split broad-phase
rebuild, and shape-level surface materials (friction/restitution
per Box2D v3).  The port is single-threaded and single-precision;
its `Settings` are Box2D's meter-based defaults.  Every ported
kernel carries a `// box2d: <symbol> <file>` parity tag so the Zig
and C can be diffed side by side.

